* set out some rules as to what You can and cannot do when accessing or using the Developer Services (clause 3);
* set out how TikTok may restrict, suspend (clause 5) or terminate (clause 7) Your access to or use of the Developer Services;
* limit losses that TikTok would otherwise be liable for (clause 10);
* require You to maintain insurance at Your own cost to cover potential liabilities that may arise in connection with access to and use of the Developer Services (clause 11.1); and
* set out how You can resolve any disputes You might have against TikTok under these Developer Terms (clause 11.8).

These TikTok Shop Developer Terms of Service (“**Developer Terms**”), govern Your integration and connection with the TikTok Shop Partner Center platform (“**TTSPC**”) and/or any other TikTok Shop platform (whether via TikTok Shop API or otherwise) (together, the “**TikTok Shop Developer Services**”), which are made available to You solely for integrating and connecting with the TikTok Shop Services as part of the services You provide to an End User. In these Developer Terms "**You**" or "**Developer**" means the person or entity that is entering into these Developer Terms (and "**Your**" shall be construed accordingly).
Your access and use of the TikTok Shop Developer Services is subject to the Global: [TikTok Shop Partner Center Terms of Service](6506bbf2de672602b7bc0697) ** and the Incorporated Developer Terms (as defined below)*.*
Where applicable, these Developer Terms also govern any other agreements or addenda (on such terms and as provided by TikTok) made in connection with these Developer Terms.
By accepting these Developer Terms or by otherwise downloading, installing, accessing, using or operating the TikTok Shop Developer Services, You agree that You have read, and that You agree to be bound by these Developer Terms. If You do not agree to these Developer Terms, You must not access or use the TikTok Shop Developer Services.
## 1. **Definitions**
